# Agent guide

This repository is {{ if .DisplayName }}{{ .DisplayName }}{{ else }}{{ .Container }}{{ end }}, the `{{ .Container }}` app of {{ .SoftwareSystem }}: one Flutter app for
Android, scaffolded by C4 Factory with the `{{ .Standard }}` Standard. Build its
